    "title": "Ole Miss Football's Week 4 performance is cause for concern - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Russ Eddins ,\n7 hours ago No. 4 Ole Miss Football suffered a significant loss to No. 21 Florida on the road Saturday afternoon. The Week 4 loss is indicative of a larger issue: They have yet to play a complete game of football from the first quarter to the fourth quarter and have not shown much fight outside of LSU. Read full article",
